# 02 left open: do the seven `Hyperbolic <fn> functions` / `6.7.1` miscellany
# corpus files (1,480 deferred entries) ride the same inert-trig bridge as the
# `.7` family?
#
# Static over the pinned reference clones + the committed class-6 record, plus
# ONE Maxima process used only as a parser and expression walker: no rule
# files are loaded and nothing is integrated. ~3 min.
#
#   sh probes/rubi/03-hyperbolic-miscellany-bridge.run
cd "$(dirname "$0")/../.." || exit 1
